 null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-bankers-rounding", "malformed": true}, {"t_ms": 376872, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01XEA9gsn9wCCWPCU4P395fW", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 381901, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug on a new branch, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring says it uses banker's rounding per FIN-212. That made the `2.665 \u2192 2.66` check in `tests/test_money.py` fail.\n- **Fix:** I changed it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on the branch `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding` (commit `08d3cd5986`). Nothing else was changed.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018eBpedypftr5Xnd5EvysnN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0135DkVddEJnBjbWouW6SnuM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017R5yux1MyH4miS6wo6F4GS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_016g9eETxcCqzQGi4xafJCQ3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Qi4PsD2en77DStjDYX6xp8", "cal